<h1>Your login code</h1>
<p>Hello <%= @user.name || "there" %>,</p>
<p>
Enter this code to sign in to <%= @operator.name %>:
</p>
<p style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 6px; margin: 16px 0;">
<%= @code %>
</p>
<p>
<%= @code %> is your <%= @operator.name %> login code. It expires in 10 minutes and can only be used once.
</p>
<p>
If you didn't request this code, you can safely ignore this email — your account is unchanged.
</p>
<p>
Thank you<br>
</p>
